{
  "schema_version": "report-evidence/1",
  "source_sha256": "462ce3d88b847f729652d959a24321706ac41b2d2e5391c4526a9911c11cf0e7",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0001",
      "text": "sUSDM.sol::decimals() incorrectly returns 6 decimals, instead of 12",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 67,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0002",
      "text": "USDM uses 6 decimals because it is minted 1:1 against USDC. sUSDM is an ERC4626 vault over USDM and sets `_decimalsOffset()` to 6.",
      "start": 69,
      "end": 199,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0003",
      "text": "ERC4626 uses this offset in share conversion:",
      "start": 201,
      "end": 246,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0004",
      "text": "Therefore, with a 6-decimal asset and a 6-decimal offset, sUSDM shares are 12-decimal shares. For example, depositing `1e6` USDM mints `1e12` sUSDM.",
      "start": 249,
      "end": 397,
      "line": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0005",
      "text": "This also matches the [docs](https://doc.monetrix.xyz/guide/faq):",
      "start": 399,
      "end": 464,
      "line": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0006",
      "text": "> USDM: 6 decimals (matches USDC). sUSDM: 12 decimals.",
      "start": 466,
      "end": 520,
      "line": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0007",
      "text": "However, the current sUSDM implementation overrides `decimals()` to return 6:",
      "start": 522,
      "end": 599,
      "line": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0008",
      "text": "As a result, sUSDM share math uses 12 decimals, while the ERC20 metadata reports 6 decimals. External integrations and protocols relying on `decimals()` may value sUSDM balances incorrectly by a factor of `1e6`.",
      "start": 602,
      "end": 813,
      "line": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0009",
      "text": "## Impact",
      "start": 815,
      "end": 824,
      "line": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0010",
      "text": "For example, an external protocol interacting with sUSDM may want to convert an sUSDM balance to USDC. The calculation may look like this:",
      "start": 826,
      "end": 964,
      "line": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0011",
      "text": "`sUSDM amount * price * 10 ** usdc.decimals() / (10 ** susdm.decimals() * price offset)`",
      "start": 966,
      "end": 1054,
      "line": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0012",
      "text": "For simplicity, assume:",
      "start": 1056,
      "end": 1079,
      "line": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0013",
      "text": "- sUSDM amount = `1e12`",
      "start": 1081,
      "end": 1104,
      "line": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0014",
      "text": "- price = `1e18`",
      "start": 1105,
      "end": 1121,
      "line": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0015",
      "text": "- price offset = `1e18`",
      "start": 1122,
      "end": 1145,
      "line": 29
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0016",
      "text": "- USDC decimals = `6`",
      "start": 1146,
      "end": 1167,
      "line": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0017",
      "text": "- sUSDM decimals = `6`",
      "start": 1168,
      "end": 1190,
      "line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0018",
      "text": "Then the result is:",
      "start": 1192,
      "end": 1211,
      "line": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0019",
      "text": "`1e12 * 1e18 * 1e6 / (1e6 * 1e18) = 1e12 USDC`",
      "start": 1213,
      "end": 1259,
      "line": 35
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0020",
      "text": "`1e12` USDC units is `1,000,000 USDC`.",
      "start": 1261,
      "end": 1299,
      "line": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0021",
      "text": "However, `1e12` sUSDM should represent 1 sUSDM, because sUSDM shares are 12 decimals. If `sUSDM.decimals()` returned 12, the result would be:",
      "start": 1301,
      "end": 1442,
      "line": 39
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0022",
      "text": "`1e12 * 1e18 * 1e6 / (1e12 * 1e18) = 1e6 USDC`",
      "start": 1444,
      "end": 1490,
      "line": 41
    },
    {
      "id": "e_462ce3d88b84_0023",
      "text": "`1e6` USDC units is `1 USDC`.",
      "start": 1492,
      "end": 1521,
      "line": 43
    }
  ]
}
